# Reference grammar: tutorials/regression/lib.sh.
# probe <file> <time> <column> <expected> <tolerance>
# purkinjeNetwork.dat columns: $1 time, $2..$6 node0..node4 activationTime [s].
# No root stimulus: the network is activated only by the tissue, at junction 4
# (node 4), and carries the wave to the root and out through junctions 2 and 3.
#
# Tissue beat at 0.05 s.
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.50  6  0.0516728377  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.50  3  0.0606872607  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.50  2  0.0648939915  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.50  4  0.0681992800  1e-6
# Tissue beat at 0.55 s, 0.5 s after the first: captured, and slower up the
# tree at the shorter diastolic interval (9.6 ms to node 1, against 9.0 ms).
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.60  6  0.5519084180  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.60  3  0.5614944410  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.60  2  0.5659640110  1e-6
probe  postProcessing/purkinjeNetwork.dat  0.60  4  0.5694740960  1e-6
